## Privacy by Design

### Requirements

| Stage | Privacy Consideration |
|-------|----------------------|
| Planning | Privacy impact assessment |
| Design | Minimize data collection |
| Development | Security controls |
| Testing | Privacy testing |
| Deployment | Access controls |
| Operations | Ongoing monitoring |
| Retirement | Secure deletion |

### Privacy Impact Assessments

Required for:
- New products processing personal data
- New data processing activities
- Significant changes to existing processing
- High-risk processing (profiling, large-scale, sensitive)

